write('llms.txt',f"# Who's flying over SF?\n\nA community archive of banner sightings above San Francisco.\n\n- [Sightings]({ORIGIN}/): Dated reports and separate undated reports.\n- [Stats and method]({ORIGIN}/stats): Estimated flight hours, spend, fuel and CO2 ranges; coverage limits, dates and assumptions.\n- [Map]({ORIGIN}/map): Candidate aircraft tracks, not confirmed advertiser matches.\n- [Source data]({REPO}/tree/main/data): CSV and JSON; CC BY 4.0.\n\nDo not treat missing reports as absence of flights, same-day brands as confirmed aircraft matches, or post dates as sighting dates.\n")
